.TH PRODBOX_control 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-control \- Local control environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox control
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and prepare the selected local control environment.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBstatus\fR
Inspect local control observations
.TP
\fBplan\fR
Render the selected kind configuration
.TP
\fBreconcile\fR
Create a new test environment's kind prerequisites and node attempt
.TP
\fBservices\fR
Deploy the pinned MinIO and Vault into a created test environment
.TP
\fBunlock\fR
Initialize or self-unseal the test environment's Vault and prove a secret round trip
.TP
\fBprotected-unlock\fR
Unseal the test environment's Vault with an operator-supplied key
.TP
\fBvault-status\fR
Read Vault's state through the Bootstrap Broker's authenticated route
.TP
\fBbroker-init\fR
Initialize Vault through the Bootstrap Broker with an operator password
.TP
\fBbroker-unseal\fR
Unseal Vault through the Bootstrap Broker with the operator password
.TP
\fBbroker-baseline\fR
Reconcile Vault's baseline through the Bootstrap Broker with the operator password
.TP
\fBlifecycle-status\fR
Read the local operation journal and report its admission verdict
.TP
\fBauthority-deploy\fR
Deploy the Lifecycle Authority runtime into the test environment
.TP
\fBbackup\fR
Back up the test environment's Vault and MinIO data inside its retained root
.TP
\fBrestore\fR
Restore a backup of the test environment's Vault and MinIO data
.TP
\fBdelete\fR
Remove a new test environment's recorded kind resources
.TP
\fBimport-artifact\fR
Import a declared bootstrap artifact
.TP
\fBdiscard-artifact-staging\fR
Discard the selected artifact staging file
.TP
\fBinspect-node-archive\fR
Inspect the retained OCI node archive
.TP
\fBinspect-image-attempt\fR
Inspect a retained image attempt
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
No documented examples.
